  "sourceTitle": "Jelly Pie",
  "sourceText": "Jelly Pie\nBy: Melissa Peterman\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 tablespoons  fruit jelly\n3 Eggs, beaten\n1 Spoonful  butter\n1 Spoonful cream\n1 Spoonful sugar\nNutmeg to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all these ingredients together and place in a cooked pie shell. Place in a 350  F. oven for about 15 minutes.\n\nAbout\n\n\nThis Southern specialty is rarely made today, even in the South.",
